1
00:00:03,201 --> 00:00:08,408
A client whose site could not be created shows Setup failed, with two buttons.

2
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:10,454
Retry runs the setup again.

3
00:00:10,454 --> 00:00:12,251
Discard gives up on it.

4
00:00:12,702 --> 00:00:17,110
Discard asks you to confirm, and then the address becomes free again, so

5
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:20,162
you can add the client again with the same name.

